{"seq":3,"slug":"gap-buffer","title":"Gap Buffer 间隙缓冲区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/text-buffer/gap-buffer","wordCount":1071,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"gap-buffer-间隙缓冲区\">Gap Buffer 间隙缓冲区</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Gap Buffer 用一个「预留空隙」的技巧，让光标附近的编辑退化为常数时间：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>gap（空隙）</strong>：连续字符数组中保留的一段未使用区间，由 <code>gapStart</code> / <code>gapEnd</code> 标记；光标所在位置就是 gap 所在位置。</li>\n<li><strong>光标局部性</strong>：插入与删除只是移动或填充 gap，在光标处为 O(1)；只有光标大幅跳转时才需要 O(n) 搬移。</li>\n<li><strong>搬移代价</strong>：gap 移得越远代价越高，因此它契合「编辑集中在光标附近」的连续输入场景。</li>\n<li><strong>容量扩张</strong>：gap 用尽时按比例扩容并搬运剩余文本，扩容策略直接影响摊还成本。</li>\n<li><strong>定位</strong>：实现最简、缓存最友好，但多光标与协同编辑能力弱，通常用于轻量编辑器。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gap-buffer-的基本原理\">Gap Buffer 的基本原理</h2><p>Gap Buffer 是最简单也最古老的编辑器文本缓冲区实现之一，GNU Emacs 自 1985 年至今一直使用这种数据结构。其核心思想是在内存中维护一段连续的字符数组，并在光标位置保留一段&quot;空隙&quot;（gap），使得光标处的插入和删除操作为 O(1)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Gap Buffer 内存布局&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;H&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;e&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;l&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;l&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; E[&quot;o&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; G1[&quot;_&quot;]&#10;        G1 --&gt; G2[&quot;_&quot;]&#10;        G2 --&gt; G3[&quot;_&quot;]&#10;        G3 --&gt; F[&quot;W&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; G[&quot;o&quot;]&#10;        G --&gt; H[&quot;r&quot;]&#10;        H --&gt; I[&quot;l&quot;]&#10;        I --&gt; J[&quot;d&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Gap Buffer 内存布局\"\n        A[\"H\"] --&gt; B[\"e\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"l\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"l\"]\n        D --&gt; E[\"o\"]\n        E --&gt; G1[\"_\"]\n        G1 --&gt; G2[\"_\"]\n        G2 --&gt; G3[\"_\"]\n        G3 --&gt; F[\"W\"]\n        F --&gt; G[\"o\"]\n        G --&gt; H[\"r\"]\n        H --&gt; I[\"l\"]\n        I --&gt; J[\"d\"]\n    end</pre><p>上图展示了字符串 <code>&quot;Hello World&quot;</code> 在光标位于 <code>o</code> 和 <code>W</code> 之间时的内存状态，下划线表示 gap 区域。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>buffer</td>\n<td>连续字符数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gapStart</td>\n<td>gap 起始位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gapEnd</td>\n<td>gap 结束位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gapSize</td>\n<td>gap 大小 = gapEnd - gapStart</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>totalSize</td>\n<td>buffer 总容量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typescript-实现\">TypeScript 实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class GapBuffer {&#10;  private buffer: string[];&#10;  private gapStart: number;&#10;  private gapEnd: number;&#10;&#10;  constructor(initialText: string, gapSize = 256) {&#10;    this.buffer = new Array(initialText.length + gapSize);&#10;    this.gapStart = 0;&#10;    this.gapEnd = gapSize;&#10;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; initialText.length; i++) {&#10;      this.buffer[gapSize + i] = initialText[i];&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  get length(): number {&#10;    return this.buffer.length - (this.gapEnd - this.gapStart);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  moveCursor(position: number): void {&#10;    if (position &lt; this.gapStart) {&#10;      const moveCount = this.gapStart - position;&#10;      for (let i = moveCount - 1; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;        this.buffer[this.gapEnd - moveCount + i] = this.buffer[position + i];&#10;      }&#10;      this.gapEnd -= moveCount;&#10;      this.gapStart = position;&#10;    } else if (position &gt; this.gapStart) {&#10;      const moveCount = position - this.gapStart;&#10;      for (let i = 0; i &lt; moveCount; i++) {&#10;        this.buffer[this.gapStart + i] = this.buffer[this.gapEnd + i];&#10;      }&#10;      this.gapStart += moveCount;&#10;      this.gapEnd += moveCount;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  insert(position: number, text: string): void {&#10;    this.moveCursor(position);&#10;    this.ensureGap(text.length);&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; text.length; i++) {&#10;      this.buffer[this.gapStart + i] = text[i];&#10;    }&#10;    this.gapStart += text.length;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  delete(position: number, count: number): void {&#10;    this.moveCursor(position);&#10;    this.gapEnd += count;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private ensureGap(needed: number): void {&#10;    if (this.gapEnd - this.gapStart &gt;= needed) return;&#10;    const newGap = Math.max(needed, 256);&#10;    const newBuffer = new Array(this.buffer.length + newGap);&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; this.gapStart; i++) {&#10;      newBuffer[i] = this.buffer[i];&#10;    }&#10;    const afterGap = this.buffer.length - this.gapEnd;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; afterGap; i++) {&#10;      newBuffer[newBuffer.length - afterGap + i] = this.buffer[this.gapEnd + i];&#10;    }&#10;    this.gapEnd = this.gapStart + (this.gapEnd - this.gapStart) + newGap;&#10;    this.buffer = newBuffer;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  getText(): string {&#10;    const before = this.buffer.slice(0, this.gapStart);&#10;    const after = this.buffer.slice(this.gapEnd);&#10;    return before.join(&#39;&#39;) + after.join(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GapBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> gapStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F9758